           Value(hfDeviceRangeBindingSet).payloadPreflightHash == Value(hfPayloadPreflight).receiptHash &&
           Value(hfDeviceRangeBindingSet).bindingSetHash == ws.WeightSafetensorsDeviceRangeBindingSetHash(Value(hfDeviceRangeBindingSet)),
           " weight safetensors manifest smoke: hf device range binding set facts")
    assert(Value(hfDeviceRangeBindingSet).bindings[0].bindingHash == Value(hfDeviceRangeBindingChunk5).bindingHash,
